id	select_type	table	partitions	type	possible_keys	key	key_len	ref	rows	filtered	Extra
1	SIMPLE	t	NULL	index_merge	idx_a,idx_b,idx_cd	idx_a,idx_b,idx_cd	42,4,8	NULL	3	100.00	Using sort_union(idx_a,idx_b,idx_cd); Using where
Warnings:
